      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I think the biggest issue with this is that colliders are VERY intensive.\nJust having them on an avatar where hair is colliding with your avatar's back is already a huge performance decrease.\nUnfortunately, Dynamic Bones wasn't really made with our extreme use cases in mind, nor is it multi-threaded meaning performance of Dynamic Bones is entirely dependant on how well core 0 of your CPU performs. :)\n(Higher core count CPUs generally perform worse per core, meaning an i5 can outperform an i7 at this for example)",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
