      "value": "@{5ae5c147906bfd12e600dc47|full_name}: Dynamic bones can be disabled (or limited) in the perofrmance settings if you didnt already know. so they could add an option for \"global dynamic bones\" so everyone can use your colliders and if you dont want dynamic bones (because of performance) then you can just disable them like always",
